  "description": "WUHGOW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H56 Ho3 N21 O14 Zn2,3.5(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 4 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.516-3.630 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.09-108.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn2Ho3(m-salen)3(N3)5(OH)2]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
